  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Grove By The Sea - Panhandle Dreams<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Coastal bliss awaits at Panhandle Dreams, a choice home at Grove by the Sea. Delight in two community pools that are open year-round, as well as on-site tennis courts/pickleball court. Stroll to Seagrove Beach for sun-kissed days in the sugar-white sand and surf. Spend tranquil evenings amidst lush landscape while dining alfresco at the outdoor table on the wraparound screened porch. Or venture out to find a selection of dining and shopping options within a mile. A prime central locale right off scenic 30A, enjoy easy access to many outdoor activities, including numerous beaches, state parks, bike trails, and coastal dune lakes. Beach gear, toys, books, and games are provided.<br><br><br><br>Unwind into vacation mode in the living area, furnished with a sofa and two armchairs. Gather for a movie around the 50” TV with DVD and Blu-ray. Prepare delicious meals in the kitchen, equipped with a double basin sink and a full suite of helpful appliances. While dinner simmers, perch at the kitchen bar with seating.<br><br><br><br>In the afternoon, enjoy a quiet read on the cushioned sofa swing. After days at the beach, rinse off in the outdoor shower.<br><br><br><br><b>THINGS TO KNOW</b>",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Coastal haven near the beach off scenic 30A with two pools & porch- dog-friendly"
        }
      ],
